{
  "description": "Mobile emulation, DPR 3, touch, R-23: the ladder of 52 refined where s59 saw the layout switch. It emulates 500x960, 540x960 and 580x960 portrait, between the phone layout at 480 and the wide one at 600; 844x450, 844x520 and 844x600 landscape, between the phone layout at 844x390 and the wide one at 1024x768; then 1100x1000, 1280x720 and 1366x1024 landscape, where the shortcut letters and the guest banner come and go; then 390x844 portrait again. Each change keeps DPR 3, touch, the mobile flag and 09's user agent (emulate sends none) and is followed by a 1 s wait, a metrics read, an assertion of what it asked for, a layout read, ARIA and a capture. It sends no input and never reloads. Runs after 52 or right after 09.",
